     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>A percent is a specific rational number and is literally per 100. <span data-math=\"n\"></span> percent, denoted <span data-math=\"n\\% \"></span>, is the fraction <span data-math=\"\\frac{n}{{100}}.\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"14\\%  = \\frac{{14}}{{100}}\"></span></p>\n<p>In decimal form: 0.14</p>"
